{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33546","headline":"闻蝉十二韵 · 许棠","name":"闻蝉十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"造化生微物，常能应候鸣。\n初离何处树，又发去年声。\n未蜕唯愁动，才飞似解惊。\n闻来邻海徼，恨起过边城。\n骚屑随风远，悠扬类雪轻。\n报秋凉渐至，嘶月思偏清。\n互默疑相荅，微摇似欲行。\n繁音人已厌，朽壳蚁犹争。\n朝士严冠饰，宫嫔逞鬓名。\n乱依西日噪，多引北归情。\n筱露凝潜吸，蛛丝忽迸萦。\n此时吟立者，不觉万愁生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}